feat: Phase 1 - Form engine, basic widgets, and save operations

Form Engine:
- DynamicField router maps widget types to Vue components
- CollectionForm auto-generates forms from config.yml field definitions
- Validation for required fields and pattern constraints
- Dirty state tracking and sticky save toolbar

Widget Components (8):
- CmsString: text input with pattern validation
- CmsText: textarea
- CmsBoolean: switch/toggle
- CmsSelect: dropdown with single/multiple select
- CmsDatetime: date/time picker
- CmsHidden: hidden field with default value
- CmsNumber: number input with min/max/step
- CmsMarkdown: plain textarea (Tiptap in Phase 3)

Save Operations:
- Local filesystem save API (dev mode)
- GitHub API save with editorial workflow (branch + commit + PR)
- Direct commit mode for trusted authors
- Content read API for loading raw markdown
- useCmsSave composable with loading/error/success states

Editor Pages:
- New item page with slug generation
- Edit item page with gray-matter frontmatter parsing
- Updated item viewer with Edit button linking to CMS editor
- Updated collection browser with native New button
